  (text "Core current = V(shunt) / R. Normal range: 0.499 + 4.99 ohm = 5.49 ohm, 7.5 mA full scale (ADCRANGE=1).\nHigh range: fit a jumper on RANGE to short the 4.99 ohm -> 0.499 ohm, 82 mA full scale.\nHook-up: on the TT breakout remove R14 (0 ohm, 0805), fit header J2, then wire\nJ2 pin 5 (VCC_REG) -> CORE pin 1, J2 pin 6 (VCCD) -> CORE pin 2, ground -> CORE pin 3.\nLayout: Kelvin traces from the shunt pads to IN+/IN-; INA228 address 0x40 (A0 = A1 = GND)."
    (at 25.4 259 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "3a285e16-5a0a-5b40-b0ff-5283e2a76781")
  )
